CAN MONETIZE THIS POSITION, BORROW AGAINST IT, pleadge it, use it as collate=
ral, USE IT IN HIS ASSET SCHEDULE WHEN APPLYING TO MORTGAGE INSTITUTIONS, ET=
C. IT IS PART OF HIS ASSETS AND IT HAS A VALUE OF APPROXIMATELY $0.5 MILLION=
. VESTING PERIOD HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH OWNERSHIP OF THE ASSET. THE ASSET HA=
